      },
      "content": "Hilariously, OpenAI’s galactic algorithm for resolving the Exponential Time Hypothesis runs an exponential time subroutine if the number of variables is less than 10^10,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000. That number is also known as infinity plus 1.",
